From 5089dbe521888f4de458f18c2bf0d917af871c16 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:37:55 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Add button to postpone an event by one week

PUT /admin/events/{id}/postpone calls Event::postpone(), which adds
the days to the current starts_on and saves through save(), so the
usual validations still apply. New records are never inserted and
the original date is restored when saving fails.
